		{"id":"9fcb2045db6af510","type":"text","text":"Hierarchy of the nobles \n\nThose with political power\n\n[[Achilles Volstar.canvas]] - Brother to Ceasar but no where near as powerful, in charge of foreign intelligence and discreet operations.\n\n[[Alivia Divina.canvas]] - most powerful mage of this era and familiar to the party, In charge of the Hellos Academy and all inner city affairs, (events, dealings between nobles, paperwork etc)\n\n[[Odanra Vilantaro.canvas]] - Dragon born woman head of international relations.\n\n[[Hilfort Binramdunjus.canvas]] - Dwarven man in master of coin. \n\n[[Fenira Xilphana.canvas]] - Wood Elf woman, in charge of agriculture.\n\n[[Azest Thyless.canvas]] - We know who she is, military and combat training in the ways of Dunamis creating specialized soldiers.\n\nDo the rest actually fucking matter, Ill make shit up that needs to be made up.\n\n\n","x":-740,"y":-400,"width":1000,"height":420}
	],
